{"id":"sportsbrut","title":"Sportsbrut","url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Sportsbrut","rev":239856,"fetched":"2026-10-16","lead":[{"t":"p","c":[{"t":"b","c":["Sportsbrut"]},", or ",{"t":"b","c":["Corporate Neu-Grunge"]},", ",{"t":"b","c":["Sports Brutalism"]}," is a graphic design aesthetic that gained prevalence in the mid-late 2010s. It diffuses the high-octane athletic branding with unpolished traits of ",{"t":"a","c":["Neubrutalism"],"id":"neubrutalism"},", which utilizes aggressive, industrial textures and bold layouts to convey speed, action, and raw kinetic energy."]},{"t":"p","c":["The aesthetic style leans on a unique middle ground where it is often more maximalist and less glossy than corporate, standard Y2K neu-grunge, but dynamic and slightly more textured than sterile, bold digital neubrutalism."]}],"sections":[{"title":"Visuals","id":"visuals","blocks":[{"t":"p","c":["The visuals of Sportsbrut are meant to evoke a sense of excitement and energy. Typography tends to be stretched or deformed. Rigid layouts and grids utilize bare-bones box, simple structures that dissect the canvas into harsh and bold chunks. However, key graphic or athlete-themed elements frequently break out of these frame boundaries to shape a sense of forward depth and explosive motion with a high-impact typography where text is compressed, heavily stretched, or distorted along with designers that frequently depend on ultra-condensed, blocky slab fonts or sans-serif to give layouts a imposing, heavy weight."]},{"t":"p","c":["Repeated stamp frames that rely on layouts frequently incorporating barcodes, ticket stubs, repeating lines, repeated post-stamp textures or technical data overlays, that replicate event credentials and athletic merchandise, along with textures where the design style features low-fidelity, raw elements such as rough halftones, photocopy grain, subtle paper distress and threshold filters, adding high-contrast color palettes, typically pairing with a limited, stark color scheme often depending on whites, blacks and monochrome grays, dominated by an intense, aggressive blast of a vibrant, single, neon primary or accent color."]}]},{"title":"Gallery","id":"gallery","blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/9/9e/Original_2d58c50df4bd0fd807c520ce79033275.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317040633","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/4a/Original_e650747d951ac19a9f7c862546630fc9.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317040748","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/8/81/Original_e817a2d3801f0f66d0eb45792186b4fc.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317040814","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/1/1b/Original_01b202db97a0bd2ff0446ab8df36c116.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317040840","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/5/50/Original_1f541bb4a3955657d3f8542f8c1fbb9e.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317040858","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e6/Original_503becdd9af2b67a330a4f44d589be72.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317040920","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/7/7f/Original_962d8e7692c5aac8317549a11c1a03a5.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041022","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/d/dc/Original_b51008dadb0cacd877ce91594533c27c.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041042","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/3/3a/Original_22b09665c4ca4a86d8cb027c72d95646.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041109","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e6/Original_b395c41e77a5452db98bc2df12fd2364.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041131","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/40/Original_ac814ea8c8bd933e55491f32afd6194a.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041149","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/6/65/Original_3c244d6feb71e07b884fef73e2399457.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041212","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/3/38/Original_88176909c195c3a034492815d9b351db.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041230","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/4b/Original_9f638ab24466d16dd2bd4d8119c98bde.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041249","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/d/d2/Original_550ad10910f9576b3511da215d774b3d.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041319","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/e/e7/Original_d7807c08f1808cf71ce4330c024a9878.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041519","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/c3/Original_c5dedf4a8e78441682debbf737b824c5.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041544","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/9/97/Original_bdc8aee5e3dcdf0e7fc4ceefda7afbe8.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041602","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/5/54/Original_d254d7ecb0e934b52a1c589ca00d8544.png/revision/latest?cb=20260317041645","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/a/a6/Original_ea8d4e39a9da00ed92f09c154588d2cb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260317041718","w":185,"h":185},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/cb/K-DA_-_MORE_ft._Madison_Beer%2C_%28G%29I-DLE%2C_Lexie_Liu%2C_Jaira_Burns%2C_Seraphine_%28Official_Music_Video%29/revision/latest?cb=20260519060814","w":185,"h":185}]}]},{"title":"Resources","id":"resources","blocks":[{"t":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"a","c":["https://cari.institute/aesthetics/sportsbrut"],"href":"https://cari.institute/aesthetics/sportsbrut"}]},{"c":[{"t":"a","c":["https://www.are.na/evan-collins-1522646491/sportsbrut"],"href":"https://www.are.na/evan-collins-1522646491/sportsbrut"}]}]}]}]}